maxDeposit.t.sol
├── given the vault has been migrated to a machine
│  └── it should return zero
└── given the vault has not been migrated to a machine
   ├── given the share limit is set to the maximum uint256 value
   │  └── it should return the maximum uint256 value
   └── given the share limit is set to a finite value
      ├── given the vault's deposit token balance is greater or equal than the asset value of the share limit
      │  └── it should return zero
      └── given the vault's deposit token balance is smaller than the asset value of the share limit
         └── it should return the difference between the asset value of the share limit and the vault's deposit token balance
